{"seq":1,"slug":"b-tree-indexes","title":"B 树索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/b-tree-indexes","wordCount":775,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"b-树索引\">B 树索引</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>B+ 树是关系数据库中最核心的索引结构。它是一种平衡多路搜索树，所有数据存储在叶子节点，叶子节点之间通过链表相连，非常适合磁盘存储和范围查询。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[&quot;根节点: 30 | 60&quot;] --&gt; L1[&quot;10 | 20&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; L2[&quot;40 | 50&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; L3[&quot;70 | 80&quot;]&#10;    L1 --&gt; D1[&quot;→ 数据页&quot;]&#10;    L2 --&gt; D2[&quot;→ 数据页&quot;]&#10;    L3 --&gt; D3[&quot;→ 数据页&quot;]&#10;    D1 -.-&gt;|链表| D2&#10;    D2 -.-&gt;|链表| D3\">graph TD\n    R[\"根节点: 30 | 60\"] --&gt; L1[\"10 | 20\"]\n    R --&gt; L2[\"40 | 50\"]\n    R --&gt; L3[\"70 | 80\"]\n    L1 --&gt; D1[\"→ 数据页\"]\n    L2 --&gt; D2[\"→ 数据页\"]\n    L3 --&gt; D3[\"→ 数据页\"]\n    D1 -.-&gt;|链表| D2\n    D2 -.-&gt;|链表| D3</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>B+ 树</th>\n<th>B 树</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据位置</td>\n<td>仅在叶子节点</td>\n<td>所有节点都可存数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叶子链表</td>\n<td>有，支持范围扫描</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询稳定性</td>\n<td>每次查询都走到叶子，路径等长</td>\n<td>路径长度不固定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扇出（Fan-out）</td>\n<td>更高，非叶节点不存数据</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围查询</td>\n<td>高效，沿叶子链表遍历</td>\n<td>需要中序遍历</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"聚簇索引与非聚簇索引\">聚簇索引与非聚簇索引</h2><p>聚簇索引决定了表中数据的物理存储顺序。每个表只能有一个聚簇索引。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>聚簇索引</th>\n<th>非聚簇索引（二级索引）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据存储</td>\n<td>叶子节点直接存储完整行数据</td>\n<td>叶子节点存储主键值（回表）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量限制</td>\n<td>每表只能一个</td>\n<td>每表可以有多个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询效率</td>\n<td>主键查询最快</td>\n<td>需要回表查数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插入性能</td>\n<td>顺序插入最优（自增主键）</td>\n<td>插入需维护索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>InnoDB 默认</td>\n<td>主键即聚簇索引</td>\n<td>其他索引均为二级索引</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- InnoDB 自动以主键创建聚簇索引&#10;CREATE TABLE users (&#10;    user_id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    username VARCHAR(50),&#10;    email VARCHAR(100)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 二级索引（非聚簇）&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_username ON users(username);&#10;&#10;-- 查询过程：&#10;-- 1. 在 idx_username 中找到 username=&#39;alice&#39; 对应的 user_id&#10;-- 2. 用 user_id 回表到聚簇索引获取完整行（回表操作）&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = &#39;alice&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- InnoDB 自动以主键创建聚簇索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    username </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 二级索引（非聚簇）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_username</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users(username);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询过程：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 1. 在 idx_username 中找到 username='alice' 对应的 user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 2. 用 user_id 回表到聚簇索引获取完整行（回表操作）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> username </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"复合索引\">复合索引</h2><p>复合索引（联合索引）是在多个列上建立的索引，遵循<strong>最左前缀原则</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE INDEX idx_composite ON orders(user_id, status, created_at);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_composite</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(user_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>查询条件</th>\n<th>是否命中索引</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WHERE user_id = 1</td>\n<td>✅ 完全命中</td>\n<td>最左前缀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WHERE user_id = 1 AND status = &#39;active&#39;</td>\n<td>✅ 完全命中</td>\n<td>前两列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WHERE user_id = 1 AND status = &#39;active&#39; AND created_at &gt; &#39;2024-01-01&#39;</td>\n<td>✅ 完全命中</td>\n<td>全部三列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WHERE status = &#39;active&#39;</td>\n<td>❌ 未命中</td>\n<td>跳过了 user_id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WHERE user_id = 1 AND created_at &gt; &#39;2024-01-01&#39;</td>\n<td>⚠️ 部分命中</td>\n<td>跳过了 status</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"索引列顺序设计原则\">索引列顺序设计原则</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"高选择性列优先 &gt; 等值查询列优先 &gt; 范围查询列靠后\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>高选择性列优先 > 等值查询列优先 > 范围查询列靠后</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 推荐：等值条件在前，范围条件在后&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_optimized ON orders(status, user_id, created_at);&#10;-- 适用于：WHERE status = &#39;active&#39; AND user_id = 1 AND created_at &gt; &#39;2024-01-01&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 推荐：等值条件在前，范围条件在后</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_optimized</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, user_id, created_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 适用于：WHERE status = 'active' AND user_id = 1 AND created_at > '2024-01-01'</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖索引\">覆盖索引</h2><p>当索引包含了查询所需的全部列时，数据库可以直接从索引中返回结果，无需回表——这就是覆盖索引（Index Only Scan）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE INDEX idx_covering ON orders(user_id, status, total);&#10;&#10;-- 覆盖索引：所有列都在索引中，无需回表&#10;SELECT user_id, status, total FROM orders WHERE user_id = 1001;&#10;&#10;-- 非覆盖：需要 created_at 列，必须回表&#10;SELECT user_id, status, total, created_at FROM orders WHERE user_id = 1001;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_covering</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(user_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, total);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 覆盖索引：所有列都在索引中，无需回表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 非覆盖：需要 created_at 列，必须回表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, total, created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"索引选择策略\">索引选择策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主键查询</td>\n<td>默认有聚簇索引，无需额外创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WHERE 等值过滤</td>\n<td>在过滤列上创建索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JOIN 连接列</td>\n<td>在外键列上创建索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ORDER BY 排序</td>\n<td>索引顺序与排序方向一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高基数列</td>\n<td>适合建索引（如 user_id）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低基数列</td>\n<td>不适合 B+ 树索引（如 gender）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频繁更新列</td>\n<td>谨慎建索引，增加写入开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"索引维护\">索引维护</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 查看索引使用情况（PostgreSQL）&#10;SELECT indexrelname, idx_scan, idx_tup_read&#10;FROM pg_stat_user_indexes&#10;WHERE schemaname = &#39;public&#39;&#10;ORDER BY idx_scan ASC;&#10;&#10;-- 删除未使用的索引&#10;DROP INDEX IF EXISTS idx_unused;&#10;&#10;-- 重建索引（消除碎片）&#10;REINDEX INDEX idx_orders_user_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看索引使用情况（PostgreSQL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> indexrelname, idx_scan, idx_tup_read</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pg_stat_user_indexes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> schemaname </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'public'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_scan </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 删除未使用的索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DROP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_unused;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 重建索引（消除碎片）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">REINDEX </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_orders_user_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"索引开销权衡\">索引开销权衡</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 收益&#10;        A[加速 SELECT]&#10;        B[加速 JOIN]&#10;        C[加速 ORDER BY]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 代价&#10;        D[占用存储空间]&#10;        E[降低 INSERT 速度]&#10;        F[降低 UPDATE/DELETE 速度]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 收益\n        A[加速 SELECT]\n        B[加速 JOIN]\n        C[加速 ORDER BY]\n    end\n    subgraph 代价\n        D[占用存储空间]\n        E[降低 INSERT 速度]\n        F[降低 UPDATE/DELETE 速度]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>无索引</th>\n<th>有索引</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SELECT 性能</td>\n<td>O(n) 全表</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INSERT 性能</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(log n) × 索引数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储空间</td>\n<td>仅数据</td>\n<td>数据 + 索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护成本</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>碎片整理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((B 树索引))&#10;    B+ 树结构&#10;      叶子节点存数据&#10;      叶子链表&#10;      平衡多路搜索树&#10;    索引类型&#10;      聚簇索引 物理顺序&#10;      非聚簇索引 回表&#10;      覆盖索引 无需回表&#10;    复合索引&#10;      最左前缀原则&#10;      列顺序设计&#10;    选择策略&#10;      高基数列优先&#10;      写多读少慎建&#10;      定期清理未用索引\">mindmap\n  root((B 树索引))\n    B+ 树结构\n      叶子节点存数据\n      叶子链表\n      平衡多路搜索树\n    索引类型\n      聚簇索引 物理顺序\n      非聚簇索引 回表\n      覆盖索引 无需回表\n    复合索引\n      最左前缀原则\n      列顺序设计\n    选择策略\n      高基数列优先\n      写多读少慎建\n      定期清理未用索引</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>B+ 树</strong>是关系数据库最核心的索引结构，叶子链表使其擅长范围查询。</li>\n<li><strong>聚簇索引</strong>决定物理存储顺序，InnoDB 中主键即聚簇索引。</li>\n<li><strong>复合索引</strong>遵循最左前缀原则，列顺序设计至关重要。</li>\n<li><strong>覆盖索引</strong>避免回表操作，是查询优化的高效手段。</li>\n<li>索引不是越多越好，需要在<strong>读取加速</strong>和<strong>写入开销</strong>之间权衡。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"B 树索引","id":"b-树索引"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"聚簇索引与非聚簇索引","id":"聚簇索引与非聚簇索引"},{"level":2,"text":"复合索引","id":"复合索引"},{"level":3,"text":"索引列顺序设计原则","id":"索引列顺序设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖索引","id":"覆盖索引"},{"level":2,"text":"索引选择策略","id":"索引选择策略"},{"level":3,"text":"索引维护","id":"索引维护"},{"level":2,"text":"索引开销权衡","id":"索引开销权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"存储过程与函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery/stored-procedures"},"next":{"title":"哈希与位图索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/hash-and-bitmap"}}